Targets:
    - 0x00172800

Title: Beasts Reset

Summary: Automated shiny reset hunt for roaming Raikou and Entei on Route 38 (English Crystal VC)

Description: |
  Automates the title screen, Continue, stepping out of the Route 38 gate (reloading until a beast has moved onto the route), pacing the grass with Repel, encounter check, and non-shiny reset.
  Crystal's original RNG determines every encounter. No target Advance or DV combination is selected.
  Stops on a verified shiny Raikou or Entei or when the user presses B. Creates no SD log.
  Supports Old 3DS/2DS at 268 MHz and New 3DS/2DS at 268 or 804 MHz.

Compatibility: Any
MemorySize: 5MiB
